      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/278dde/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-06-30T16:46:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, I used Rook City Wraith, Beardy Ra, F6 Tempest and Santa Guise against Wager Master.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It was one of those games where all Heroes&nbsp;start with&nbsp;odd HP, one Wageling came out, and then Losing to the Odds. So, I won before I even got to play. Whee!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>BUT, I also got 2 achievements: Paparazzi AND Extreme Hostage Situation, because I won without using powers AND I won without playing cards. In the same game!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And it just so happened that this was in Megalopolis, so these achievements seemed especially fitting.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks, Wager Master!</p>",
